@startuml
title 智颐养老系统 - 全局异常处理机制

skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FFF5F5
  BorderColor #CD5C5C
  FontSize 11
}

class "客户端" as client

class "GlobalExceptionHandler\n@RestControllerAdvice" as handler #FFE4E1 {
  + handleAccessDeniedException(): AjaxResult
  + handleServiceException(): AjaxResult
  + handleRuntimeException(): AjaxResult
  + handleException(): AjaxResult
  + handleBindException(): AjaxResult
  + handleMethodArgumentNotValid(): AjaxResult
  + handleDemoModeException(): AjaxResult
}

class "AjaxResult\n统一响应" as result {
  + int code
  + String msg
  + Object data
}

class "ServiceException\n业务异常" as se
class "DemoModeException\n演示模式" as dme
class "BaseException\n基础异常" as be
class "UserNotExistsException" as une
class "UserPasswordNotMatchException" as upn
class "CaptchaException" as ce
class "CaptchaExpireException" as cee
class "BlackListException" as ble
class "UserPasswordRetryLimitExceed" as upr
class "FileSizeLimitExceeded" as fsl
class "FileNameLengthLimitExceeded" as fnl
class "InvalidExtensionException" as iee
class "FileUploadException" as fue

se --|> be : 继承
dme --|> be : 继承
une --|> be : 继承
upn --|> be : 继承
ce --|> be : 继承
cee --|> be : 继承
ble --|> be : 继承
upr --|> be : 继承
fsl --|> be : 继承
fnl --|> be : 继承
iee --|> be : 继承
fue --|> be : 继承

client --> handler : HTTP请求/异常
handler --> result : 统一封装返回
handler ..> se : 捕获处理
handler ..> dme : 捕获处理
handler ..> une : 捕获处理

note right of handler
  @RestControllerAdvice
  
  异常转标准JSON返回:
  {code, msg, data}
  
  HTTP状态码:
  403 - 无权限
  500 - 业务异常
  400 - 参数校验
  401 - 未认证(EntryPoint)
end note

note left of se: 入住重复/设备重名/合同到期
note left of dme: 演示模式禁止写操作
note left of une: 用户不存在/密码错误/黑名单

@enduml
